
>> Animal := Ikintu gishya.
Animal bigeze: ['gishya'] kora: { <- ubwacyo gishya init.
}.

Animal bigeze: ['init'] kora: {
	icyacyo sound := ['?'].
	icyacyo legs := 4.
}.

>> Dog := Animal gishya.
Dog bigeze: ['init'] kora: {
	ubwacyo init.
	icyacyo sound := ['barks'].
}.

Animal bigeze: ['inyandiko'] kora: { <- icyacyo legs inyandiko + icyacyo sound.
}.

>> poodle := Dog gishya.
Ibisohoka andika: poodle, umurongo-mushya.

